rever until our hero spies her masturbating and plunges her life into chaos."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is unable to resist our hero’s coercion, but remains resolute that she is only doing these things to protect her family.　But by reluctantly complying with his lecherous demands, she begins to learn things about herself she never thought possible..."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c45383"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"結婚2年目の専業主婦。穏やかで心優しく、控えめな性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛する夫との穏やかな生活に満足している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ最近夫が忙しく、あまりかまってもらえないのがちょっと不満。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"このまま平穏な暮らしを続けて行きたいと思っていたが、偶然にもオナニーを主人公に目撃されてしまったことで、運命が狂っていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公からの脅迫に対して拒むことができず、家庭を守るためだから……と耐え忍んでしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ｈな要求に心ならずも答えていくうち、彼女自身も知らなかった一面が目覚めて……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12371","sourceWorkId":"13823","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"結婚2年目の専業主婦。穏やかで心優しく、控えめな性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛する夫との穏やかな生活に満足している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ最近夫が忙しく、あまりかまってもらえないのがちょっと不満。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"このまま平穏な暮らしを続けていきたいと思っていたが、偶然にもオナニーを主人公に目撃されてしまったことで、運命が狂っていく。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"62795"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"24 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12371","sourceWorkId":"13823","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12371","sourceWorkId":"13823","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"g","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12371","sourceWorkId":"13823","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"156 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12371","sourceWorkId":"13823","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"85 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12371","sourceWorkId":"13823","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label